WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.560
Hi, I'm Tilly! Your config can be split into several files now.

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:08.740
Config files lists them all, in the order they merge.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:13.610
Drop a file into config dot d, and it applies at once.

00:00:15.376 --> 00:00:18.096
Config origin tells you which file sets a key.

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:24.762
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
